            "body": "Oh, I guess it can be rewritten like that, but I since the code uses only two bits of information (id and range) it is simpler to store that. Also, now that I think about it, if it was a weaktable, what if an element at an earlier index gets garbage collected first, before those in the tail? That would break the list.",
